  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Implement U1 using Spring Boot @ConfigurationProperties for key-value pairs with a custom property for instance count to support deployment scaling.",
    "Fix Kafka binder in U3 by updating Spring Cloud Stream Kafka dependencies to the latest stable version and addressing broker connection timeout issues.",
    "Integrate RxJava processor in U6 by adding RxJava 3 support, configuring processor beans in Spring Cloud Stream, and ensuring compatibility with existing modules.",
    "Documentation for U4 and U8 to be written in Markdown format, version-controlled in Git, and published to gh_pages branch for public access.",
    "For U7, the banner will be an ASCII art file embedded in the application resources and loaded during shell server boot-up using Spring Boot's banner mechanism."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The development is for an existing Spring Cloud Dataflow project with Java 17, Spring Boot 3, and Spring Cloud components.",
    "U5 study of Concourse CI involves reading official documentation, setting up a local Concourse instance, creating a sample pipeline, and documenting findings in a report.",
    "All user stories are developed sequentially by a single developer, with no parallel tasks or external dependencies.",
    "Testing includes unit tests for code changes and integration tests where applicable, using appropriate frameworks like JUnit and MockMvc.",
    "Documentation activities assume access to existing project resources and no need for graphic design beyond ASCII art for U7."
  ],
